{"seq":4,"slug":"alpha-research","title":"Alpha 研究","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/alpha-research","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"alpha-signal-mining","title":"Alpha 信号挖掘方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/alpha-research/alpha-signal-mining","wordCount":2270,"readingTime":10},{"seq":2,"slug":"alternative-data","title":"另类数据与非传统因子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/alpha-research/alternative-data","wordCount":2161,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"ml-factor-models","title":"机器学习因子模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/factor-models/alpha-research/ml-factor-models","wordCount":2358,"readingTime":10}],"introMarkdown":"# Alpha 研究\n\n本章探讨超额收益（Alpha）的前沿研究方向。第一篇系统介绍 Alpha 信号挖掘的方法论——从特征工程、信号回测到过拟合控制的完整流程。第二篇聚焦另类数据与非传统因子——卫星图像、文本情绪、社交媒体等新兴数据源如何转化为投资信号。第三篇讨论机器学习在因子模型中的应用——从线性模型到深度学习，ML 方法如何革新传统因子研究。三篇文档共同描绘量化 Alpha 研究从传统到前沿的演进图景。\n"}